| **`hasMoreOrders` + `allOrders` link** | Tells clients whether to offer a "View all orders" button and where to fetch them. |
| **Orders sorted newest first** | Documented guarantee, so clients don't need to re-sort. |
| **`requestId`** | Simplifies debugging and support tickets. |

## Edge Cases

