  "errors": [
    {
      "status": "404",
      "code": "USER_NOT_FOUND",
      "title": "User not found",
      "detail": "No user exists with id 'usr_invalid123'."
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "requestId": "req_f1a2b3c4"
  }
}
```

## Security Considerations
- **Never return** password hashes, internal flags, full payment card numbers, or other users' data.
- If payment info is needed, include only something like `{ "brand": "visa", "last4": "4242" }`.
- Enforce authorization so users can access only their own profile unless they're an admin.

