| **ISO 8601 UTC timestamps** | Unambiguous and easy to parse. |
| **Prefixed string IDs** (`usr_`, `ord_`) | Self-describing, safe in URLs, and don't leak sequential counts. |
| **`snake_case` keys** | Consistent naming throughout. |
| **Sorted newest first** | Matches the "last five" requirement; sorting is stated in the link to the full list. |
| **Sensitive data excluded** | No password hashes, full payment details, or internal flags. |
| **Summary line items** | Keeps the payload small; full detail is reachable via `links.self`. |

