| **Explicit `sort`** | Documents that "last five" means most recent by `placed_at`. |
| **`recent_orders` nested as an object** | Can grow (cursor, filters) without restructuring. |
| **snake_case** | Consistent naming; pick one convention and stick with it. |
| **Sensitive data excluded** | No password hash, full card numbers, or internal flags. |

