## 8. Checklist before shipping

- [ ] Money is integer minor units everywhere; no floats anywhere in the payload.
- [ ] All timestamps are UTC RFC 3339 with `Z`.
- [ ] `orders.items` is sorted by `placedAt` descending, and the limit of 5 is enforced server-side (not by the client slicing a larger list).
- [ ] No PII leakage: no PAN, no password hash, no internal notes, no `dateOfBirth` by default.
- [ ] Order addresses are snapshots, not live references.
- [ ] `nextCursor` is opaque and keyset-based (not an offset) — offsets skip/duplicate rows when new orders land mid-scroll.
- [ ] The response validates against a schema in CI (e.g. JSON Schema + `ajv`, or the TS types above via `zod`).
- [ ] `meta.requestId` is present and matches the `X-Request-Id` response header for support tracing.

