## Field Reference

**Envelope**

| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `id` | string | Unique event ID. **The idempotency key.** Never reused, never changes on retry. |
| `type` | string | `subscription.renewed`. Use a dotted `resource.past-tense-action` convention. |
| `api_version` | string | Date-based version of the *schema*. Pin it in your handler. |
| `created_at` | string | When the event was generated (not when delivered). |
| `livemode` | boolean | `false` for sandbox/test traffic — let consumers skip it. |
| `delivery.attempt` | int | 1 on first try, increments per retry. Useful for alerting on flaky endpoints. |
| `data.object` | object | The full subscription snapshot *after* renewal. |
| `links` | object | Deep links to the canonical resources. |

**Subscription (`data.object`)**

| Field | Notes |
|---|---|
| `status` | `active`, `trialing`, `past_due`, `canceled`. Reflects post-renewal state. |
| `plan` | The plan billed for *this* renewal. `amount` is per-unit, in minor units. |
| `quantity` | Units billed. `plan.amount × quantity` should equal `payment.amount_due` (absent discounts/tax). |
| `current_period_start` / `current_period_end` | The new billing window. `current_period_start` ≈ renewal date. |
| `next_billing_date` | Precomputed so consumers can schedule their own reminders without a second API call. |
| `renewal.number` | Monotonic renewal counter for this subscription. Great for analytics and detecting skipped cycles. |
| `renewal.billing_reason` | `subscription_cycle` \| `trial_conversion` \| `manual` \| `proration`. Tells you *why* it renewed. |
| `payment` | Outcome of the charge. On failure, `status` is `failed` and `failure_code` is populated. |
| `payment_method` | Tokenized reference + safe display fields only. **Never include PAN, CVV, or a raw card number.** |
| `metadata` | Merchant-supplied key/values echoed back. Useful for correlating to internal orders. |

---

## Companion Events

A renewal isn't always a success. Emit a sibling event rather than mutating this one:

| Event | When |
|---|---|
| `subscription.renewed` | Charge succeeded, period advanced. |
| `subscription.renewal_failed` | Charge declined or errored. Same envelope; `payment.status = "failed"`, `payment.failure_code` set. |
| `subscription.trial_converted` | `billing_reason = "trial_conversion"`, `trial_end` set to the prior value. |
| `subscription.canceled` | Emitted when `cancel_at_period_end` takes effect at period end. |

